 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["",["$","$L4","1",{"href":"https://filetools.eu","className":"text-violet-400 hover:text-violet-300 underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors","children":"FileTools"}],".eu is a free online file conversion platform. PDF to Word, image resizing, format conversion, compression — the usual suspects, but executed cleanly."]}],["$","h2","5",{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"What makes it different"}],["$","p","7",{"className":"text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["Most free conversion sites are minefields of ads and dark patterns. FileTools takes a different approach: minimal interface, fast processing, no mandatory account creation."]}],["$","p","9",{"className":"text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["The tool handles common conversions: PDF to DOCX, PNG to JPG, image compression, PDF merging and splitting. Processing happens server-side and files are deleted after conversion."]}],["$","h2","11",{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Supported formats"}],["$","p","13",{"className":"text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PNG, JPG, WEBP, SVG, GIF, and more. The converter recognizes input format automatically and suggests output options."]}],["$","h2","15",{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Privacy"}],["$","p","17",{"className":"text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["Files are processed and deleted. No account required for basic conversions. The site uses HTTPS and doesn't require cookies for core functionality."]}],["$","h2","19",{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Verdict"}],["$","p","21",{"className":"text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["If you need quick file conversions without the usual web tool annoyances, FileTools delivers. Bookmarkable for those regular PDF-to-Word moments."]}],"$L18","$L19"]}],"$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d"]}]
